    <comment>New package python-kornia-rs for openSUSE:Factory from science:machinelearning (ComfyUI cone). pluskalm is the science:machinelearning package maintainer.

INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together (ComfyUI cone):
  * sr#1372780 python-trampoline
  * sr#1372737 python-av (devel:languages:python; Factory 14.2.0, need &gt;= 16 for comfyui)
  * remaining cone packages from science:machinelearning being submitted in this batch

Fri Aug 21 08:50:08 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal &lt;mpluskal@suse.com&gt;

- Initial package of python-kornia-rs 0.1.14:
  * Low-level computer vision library implemented in Rust with
    Python bindings (maturin)
  * Image I/O (JPEG via libjpeg-turbo, PNG, TIFF, WebP), image
    processing, AprilTag detection and 3D vision helpers
  * 0.1.14 makes the turbojpeg Python API actually reachable
    (encode/decode/read/write_image_jpegturbo)
</comment>
