    <comment>Update to 0.2.0. Upstream re-released 0.1.15's code as 0.2.0 because 0.1.15 shipped breaking Rust API changes in a patch release and was yanked from crates.io; the Python surface is unchanged from 0.1.15 apart from kornia_rs.__version__. Details in .changes.</comment>
